ow_current_item" examples:\n- get item info\n- item status\n\nIntent "rewind_substate" examples:\n- let\'s rewind the item substate\n- move item state backward\n\nIntent "create_item" examples:\n- let\'s create a new item\n- let\'s start it\n- run it\n\nIntent "approve_idea" examples:\n- use this idea\n- approve this one\n- select this idea\n\nIntent "select_idea_by_reference" examples:\n- {\'user\': \'select idea 3\', \'intent\': {\'name\': \'select_idea_by_reference\', \'parameters\': {\'reference\': \'3\'}}}\n- {\'user\': \'use the immigration case\', \'intent\': {\'name\': \'select_idea_by_reference\', \'parameters\': {\'reference\': \'immigration\'}}}\n- {\'user\': \'pick Brown v. Board\', \'intent\': {\'name\': \'select_idea_by_reference\', \'parameters\': {\'reference\': \'brown\'}}}\n\n    Return ONLY a JSON object matching this schema:\n\n    {\n      "intent": string,\n      "reasoning": string | null\n    }\n\n    Respond ONLY with valid JSON. Do not include commentary.\n',)
